# Chakra React Table Project Context

## Acronyms

- MRT: Material React Table
- CRT: Chakra React Table
- CUI: Chakra UI
- MUI: Material UI
- TRT: TanStack React Table

## Overview

Converting MRT to CRT, a fully featured CUI V2 implementation of TRT V8 based off of MUI (MUI) version

## Objectives

1. Replace MUI with CUI v2
2. Replace @mui/icons-material with react-icons (primarily using react-icons/md)
3. Maintain compatibility with upstream MRT repository that will continue to be developed but will always use MUI
4. Preserve file structure and component naming conventions

## Migration Strategy

1. Keep MRT\_ prefix for existing files to maintain upstream compatibility
2. Use CRT\_ prefix for new Chakra-specific components
3. Preserve component APIs and behavior
4. Maintain original variable names (e.g., muiSkeletonProps) for easier Git merges

